@startuml
skinparam handwritten true
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rect
skinparam defaultFontName FG Virgil
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Drone Tech" as Actor
participant RegisterDSLPluginUI as UI <<presentation>>
participant RegisterDSLPluginController as Controller <<application>>
participant DSLPlugin as Domain <<domain>>
database DSLPluginRepository as Repository <<repository>>

Actor --> UI: Register DSL Plugin
activate UI

UI --> Actor: Request DSL Version and Class Name
Actor --> UI: Provide DSL Version and Class Name

    UI -> Controller: registerDSLPlugin(dslVersion, className)
    activate Controller

        note right of Controller : hidden authorization user guarantee \n(see specific diagram)

        note right of Controller : Simplified persistence\n(see specific diagram)

        Controller -> Domain: create(dslVersion, className)

        Controller -> Repository: save(DSLPlugin)
        activate Repository

        Repository --> Controller: DSLPlugin
        deactivate Repository

        Controller --> UI: DSLPlugin
    deactivate Controller

UI --> Actor: Display plugin info or error
deactivate UI

@enduml